This licence covers the code and documentation in this repository. It does not
cover the third-party data the code downloads, nor the redistributed boundary
data below, each of which carries its own terms:

  data/amazon_domain.geojson and data/grid_amazon_0p25.csv are derived from
  HydroBASINS v1c (WWF / HydroSHEDS, free for non-commercial use, attribution
  required) and the RESOLVE Ecoregions 2017 dataset (CC BY 4.0). They are
  redistributed here, in derived form, for research reproducibility, with
  attribution to both sources.

  ERA5 data is provided by the Copernicus Climate Change Service and is subject
  to the Copernicus licence. NOAA CDR AVHRR LAI/FAPAR is a NOAA Climate Data
  Record. Neither is redistributed here; both are downloaded from source.

  The replicated paper — Araujo, Assuncao, Hirota and Scheinkman (2023), PNAS
  120(46), e2312451120 — is the authors' work and is not covered by this
  licence. Please cite it.
